OL,3,GNEWSAEx-hospital boss 'astonished' by
OL,4,Astaff 'complacency' after Lucy Letby's
OL,5,Aarrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe former boss of the hospital where
OL,8,FLucy Letby worked has said she was
OL,9,F"astonished" by a "general feeling of
OL,10,Fcomplacency" when she arrived weeks
OL,11,Fafter the nurse's arrest.
OL,13,FDr Susan Gilby joined Countess of
OL,14,FChester Hospital in August 2018. She
OL,15,Fsaid she expected people to be "reeling
OL,16,Ffrom shock and distress" but found them
OL,17,F"quite relaxed".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
