OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEx-hospital boss 'astonished' by
OL,4,Astaff 'complacency' after Lucy Letby's
OL,5,Aarrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Thirlwall Inquiry report, published
OL,8,Fon Tuesday, found hospital executives
OL,9,Fdid not expect the police investigation
OL,10,Fto "lead anywhere" and said this was
OL,11,Fconsistent with their earlier conduct.
OL,13,FEx-senior hospital managers named in
OL,14,Fthe report have said they are reviewing
OL,15,FThirlwall's findings, but cannot
OL,16,Fcomment further while other
OL,17,Finvestigations remain active.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
